      "created_at": "2015-01-08T05:17:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Received by AA in Indy!</p><p>I think any pattern one might find in the US domestic shipping is going to be thrown off by the fact that GtG has combined items from the Sentinel Tactics Kicstarter with the Wrath of the Cosmos preorder, where possible.</p><p>I think the original projection for ship date for the painted minis was March or something, so this is nice and early. A very happy surprise.</p>",
